# ToFahrenheit celsius → the temperature in degrees Fahrenheit (× 1.8, then + 32)
ToFahrenheit ⇐ 32⊸+∘(1.8⊸×)

# ToCelsius fahrenheit → the temperature in degrees Celsius (- 32, then ÷ 1.8)
ToCelsius ⇐ ÷⟜1.8∘(-⟜32)

# miles TotalKm miles → the sum of both distances in kilometres (1.6 per mile)
TotalKm ⇐ +○(1.6⊸×)

# bag SpareKg limit → the kilograms left before the bag reaches the limit
SpareKg ⇐ -˜

# SquareMetres feet → the area in square metres of a square room with sides of that many feet (0.3 m each)
SquareMetres ⇐ ×˜∘(0.3⊸×)
